        "jp": "すごい瘴気じゃ。\r\nとても進むことはできん。\r\n闇のクリスタルはこの先にあるんじゃが……。",
        "official_en": "The Dark Crystal lies ahead—yet with this overwhelming miasma, we are at an impasse...",
        "real_en": "The miasma is terrible. We can't get through it. The Dark Crystal is beyond here, but..."
